SUMMARY:Deadline: Radical Sabbatical 2027: six-month residencies on touch a
 t the University of Birmingham (GBP 3\,500 fee + GBP 500 production\, UK-b
 ased artists)
DESCRIPTION:Radical Sabbatical is a collaboration between Eastside Projects
  and University Collections at the University of Birmingham that gives two
  artists a six-month residency centred on research and development.\n\nOrg
 anisation: Eastside Projects with University Collections\, University of B
 irmingham\nLocation: University of Birmingham\, Birmingham\, UK (in person
 \, research residency). Open to artists based in the UK only.\nAward: GBP 
 3\,500 artist fee plus GBP 500 production budget per artist\; two artists 
 selected.\nDuration: 6 months\, January to June/July 2027\n\nMore: https:/
 /eastsideprojects.org/projects/apply-now-radical-sabbatical-2027-residenci
 es/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://eastsideprojects.org/projects/apply-now-radical-sabbatical-2027
 -residencies/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:University of Birmingham\, Birmingham\, UK (in person\, research r
 esidency). Open to artists based in the UK only.
END:VEVENT
